Soo-saar qor: ['Test object'], sadar-cusub.
>> a := Walax cusub. 

a marka: ['item:'] samee: { :moment
	iska-leh moment := moment. 
}.

a marka: ['item'] samee: { <- iska-leh moment.
}.

>> today := Xilli cusub aag: ['CEST'], sannad: 2026, bil: 7.
a item: today.
Soo-saar qor: a item, sadar-cusub.
a save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].

